              "value": {
                "expression": "rule of thirds, asymmetric composition, glitch art, pixelation, VHS noise, octane render, unreal engine, 8k ::7 --ar 16:9 --s 1200\nDesign a glitchy, post-analog world with digital decay and broken visuals. Utilize pixelated elements, VHS noise, and neon glitches to create a fragmented aesthetic. Use bold, contrasting colors against muted backgrounds for a high-contrast, otherworldly feel. The composition should follow asymmetrical rules, focusing on chaotic yet intentional visual balance. Include:"
